This project calls Strands Agents (https://github.com/strands-agents/sdk-python) and
Strands Decider (https://github.com/strands-labs/strands-decider), both Apache-2.0,
as installed dependencies. No source code from those projects is vendored here; the
System One request/response shapes are used as documented by strands-decider.
All job postings and the candidate profile under examples/ are synthetic and fictional.
